BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (         fell toward River, the valleys and mountains rejoiced, tripling the gift through their ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (        joy, so that River swelled with abundance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (      River now faced a choice. He could keep all the water, growing mighty and deep. But River ) Tj ET
