BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (      The two villages had long shared water between their sacred wells, each gift tripling as i) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (        t crossed the valley. For many seasons, both prospered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (      Then came a harsh winter. The Northern elder gazed into their well and saw their reflectio) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (        n distorted by ice. "Perhaps the South took too much last time," they thought, though fr) Tj ET
