BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (        y truly value.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (      The Southern well-keeper waited by the valley's edge, bucket ready to return the customary) Tj ET
