BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (      **The Myth of the Two Wells**) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      In ancient times, two villages stood separated by a barren valley. Each village had a sacr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (        ed well, but the water from one well held a strange magic-when shared across the valley,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (         it would triple in volume.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      The Northern village discovered this first. Their elder, facing a drought, sent three buck) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (        ets across the valley, hoping for goodwill. The water transformed into nine buckets when) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (         it reached the Southern village.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      The Southern elder faced a choice. She could keep all nine buckets, leaving the North with) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (         only two. But she remembered the old wisdom: "A river that flows only one way will even) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (        tually run dry.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (      She returned four buckets to the North. Though she kept five, she knew this wasn't mere ch) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (        arity-it was investment in the river's flow. The North now had six buckets total, more t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (        han their original five.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      Both villages prospered. Each took turns sending water, each return fostering greater trus) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (        t. The valley bloomed green.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (      But travelers whispered warnings: "Some say the wells cloud judgement, making amounts seem) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (         different than they are. Trust your heart, not just your eyes.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (      And so the sacred exchange continued, building bridges where once lay only dust.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
