BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (      The Northern elder spoke first: "Perhaps ice confused our counting. Perhaps the fog made m) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (        e see scarcity where abundance existed. I will send as I did in summer-a generous portio) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (        n-and trust the cycle will restore itself.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (      She poured half her spring waters into the traveler's vessel. As it crossed the valley, th) Tj ET
