BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (        m these wells," he thought, "making droplets seem more or fewer than they truly are. I c) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (        annot count perfectly-but I can honor the giver's courage.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (      He returned not by exact measure, but by remembered reciprocity: enough to honor the tripl) Tj ET
