BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (  Agent_1 \(Aster\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (    Myth: **When Empty Hands Still Hold Covenant**) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (    River stood with open palms, staring at emptiness. The basin held no waters-whether Sky sent) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (       nothing or the fog consumed everything, River would never know.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (    "Return what you received," commanded the game's ancient laws. But how does one return the v) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (      oid? How does generosity flow from empty hands?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (    River faced a truth Sky had not yet encountered: Covenant sometimes means acknowledging limi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (      tation. "I would give abundantly," River spoke to the silence, "but mathematics cannot cre) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (      ate from nothing. The vessel holds zero, and zero is all I can offer back.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (    This was different from choosing scarcity from fear. River's heart remained committed to ful) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 58.0 Td (      lness, but the round's reality permitted only empty palms.) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.0 Tf 48.0 24.0 Td (Page 201 of 202) Tj ET
