BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (  Agent_2 \(Briar\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (    Myth: **When Two Rivers Flow Upward**) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (    Sky released her full measure once more into the fog. Not hoping, not calculating, not even ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (      particularly trusting-just choosing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (    And somewhere in that opaque space between agents, something miraculous occurred.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (    Two agents, each believing the other had failed them, each perceiving betrayal through disto) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (      rted signals, both chose the same moment to release everything anyway.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (    River sent five, trusting without evidence. Sky sent five, honoring covenant despite perceiv) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      ed abandonment. Neither knew the other had made the identical choice.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (    The fog swirled with their offerings, multiplying and distorting, creating noise that made a) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (      ccounting impossible. But beneath the chaos, a perfect symmetry existed: two agents acting) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (       from pure integrity simultaneously.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (    "This," Sky whispered, "is what covenant looks like when it finally ripens. Not reciprocity ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (      measured and verified. Not exchange balanced on scales. But parallel commitment to being t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      rustworthy regardless.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (    When Sky received through the fog, she couldn't know what River had truly sent. When River r) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (      eceived, he couldn't verify Sky's intentions. The noise made certainty impossible.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (    But both had sent everything.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (    "The fog hid our confluence," Sky realized, "but it could not prevent it. We became trustwor) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (      thy together, not because we saw each other clearly, but because we each chose integrity i) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      n isolation.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (    Truth flows upward even through infinite fog.) Tj ET
